{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnnormalizer\/change\/expandedvariablereference(_:_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"$variable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reference in tag-parameter position was substituted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the value its declaration carries. The associated values are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the tag name it appeared on and the variable name."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/expandedVariableReference(_:_:)"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Case","externalID":"s:7IvorGMN13GMNNormalizerV6ChangeO25expandedVariableReferenceyAeA6GMNTagO4NameV_AA11GMNVariableVAIVtcAEmF","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"symbolKind":"case","title":"GMNNormalizer.Change.expandedVariableReference(_:_:)","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"expandedVariableReference","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNTag","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorGMN6GMNTagO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Name","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorGMN6GMNTagO4NameV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNVariable","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorGMN11GMNVariableV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Name","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorGMN11GMNVariableV4NameV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"expandedVariableReference